<title>USA: Balchem Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Balchem Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SLATE HILL, N.Y. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>($000 Omitted Except for Net Earnings Per Share)</p>
<p>	    For the Three Months Ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>					1997	     1996</p>
<p> Sales				6,834	   6,258</p>
<p> Pre-Tax Operating Profit     1,129	     668</p>
<p> Taxes				  412	     233</p>
<p> Net Income			   717	     434</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share		0.23	    0.14</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610 ))</p>
